1
00:00:00,574 --> 00:00:02,244
(Howard:)Except for AppleCare.

2
00:00:02,244 --> 00:00:04,974
(Howard:)That pays for itself
in the long run.

3
00:00:07,515 --> 00:00:08,345
(Raj:)Hi.

4
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:09,750
(Leonard:)Hey, where'd you go?

5
00:00:09,751 --> 00:00:12,851
(Penny:)I got you a little something
to cheer you up.

6
00:00:12,854 --> 00:00:13,854
(Leonard:)Really?

7
00:00:13,855 --> 00:00:15,425
(Leonard:)Sex last night,
pancakes this morning--

8
00:00:15,424 --> 00:00:18,094
(Leonard:)Am I dying?
(chuckles)

9
00:00:18,093 --> 00:00:20,893
(Penny:)Just open it.

10
00:00:20,896 --> 00:00:21,896
(Leonard:)A cap and gown?

11
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:23,727
(Leonard:)Why do I need a cap and gown?

12
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:26,702
(Penny:)Because you are giving
your commencement speech.

13
00:00:26,701 --> 00:00:27,701
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

14
00:00:27,702 --> 00:00:28,972
(Penny:)I called your old high school

15
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:32,410
(Penny:)and convinced them to let you
give your speech over Skype.

16
00:00:32,407 --> 00:00:33,407
(Leonard:)Really?

17
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:34,578
That's amazing!

18
00:00:34,576 --> 00:00:36,606
(Leonard:)And you gave me the robes
to give it in.

19
00:00:36,611 --> 00:00:37,811
(Leonard:)Thank you.

20
00:00:37,813 --> 00:00:38,813
(Penny:)Yeah, now about those--

21
00:00:38,814 --> 00:00:40,284
(Penny:)uh, they came from
a costume shop,

22
00:00:40,282 --> 00:00:42,812
(Penny:)and all they had left
was sexy graduate,

23
00:00:42,818 --> 00:00:43,888
(Penny:)so they...

24
00:00:43,885 --> 00:00:46,655
(Penny:)might be a little short.

25
00:00:46,655 --> 00:00:49,485
(Leonard:)Short and sexy,
that's my wheelhouse.

26
00:00:49,491 --> 00:00:59,021
Yeah!

